From 271378774abc6bc515a7d0f202500b8d3a3ed764 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:31:29 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Restore CRX verifier and lookalike URL throttle

Partially reverts two cromite patches whose collateral weakened
security once extensions are enabled:

- Enable-component-updater had skipped the CRX ID / required-key
  check on Android and swapped the publisher key for Cromite's, so a
  crafted .crx could claim an installed extension's ID. crx_verifier
  is back to vanilla; the is_extension parameter that only selected
  the key is removed from all callers.
- Disable-various-metrics had dropped LookalikeUrlNavigationThrottle
  together with the metrics throttle. The lookalike check is local
  (bundled list, no network) and is registered again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
